# Task 149-003: Sprint Controller Mode-Aware Routing

## Approach
1. Create `src/orchestra/task-mode-runner.ts` — centralized task-mode execution
2. Patch `src/orchestra/sprint-controller.ts` — add mode guard at runSprint entry
3. Create `tests/orchestra/mode-aware-routing.test.ts` — 8 tests

## Key Decisions
- `deckent_style` may not exist yet on config type (Task 149-001 dependency)
  - Use optional access `config.deckent_style` with type assertion if needed
  - The guard checks for 'task' explicitly, defaults to sprint behavior
- `buildRunTask` already exists in `src/cli/commands/run.ts` — reuse it
- `spawnWorkerMultiProvider` exists in `src/cli/commands/spawn.ts` — import from there
- `eventBus` from `./event-bus.js` — already in sprint-controller imports

